UID:60995-1785596400-1785607200@golocal.coop
SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Jeremy Gorman Project
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come together. \nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tasting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from across the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \nThe Jeremy Gorman Project\nJeremy Gorman is a versatile guitarist and singer-songwriter whose soulful blend of rock\, blues\, folk\, and jam-band influences creates music that’s both timeless and alive. With roots in New Orleans and a musical journey that’s taken him across genres and stages\, Jeremy delivers heartfelt performances full of groove\, grit\, and spirit. \nDetails\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/saturday-live-music-at-spicy-vines-feat-jeremy-gorman-project/
LOCATION:Spicy Vines\, 441 Healdsburg Ave.\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
