UID:71072-1785603600-1785610800@golocal.coop
SUMMARY:River Run + Cold Plunge (with Sauna!)
DESCRIPTION:Trade your Saturday afternoon for a tidal adventure on the Petaluma River. Launching from downtown Petaluma\, this guided Downriver Run takes you six scenic miles through wide-open wetlands and peaceful river landscapes in easy-to-use Hobie pedal kayaks. \nFrom 3–5 pm\, ride the outgoing tide from The Floathouse Petaluma to Lakeville Landing Marina\, where the experience can continue with an optional discounted sauna + cold plunge session at Sundrop Sauna from 5–6:30 pm. Warm up in the sauna\, cool down with a plunge\, and relax riverside in the golden evening light. \nWant to make it a floating picnic party? Add a Bella Box from La Bella Charcuterie\, with omnivore\, vegetarian\, and vegan options available. \nThis is Sonoma County river culture at its finest: movement\, nature\, community\, wellness\, and good vibes — all in one unforgettable afternoon. \nHosted by The Floathouse Petaluma\, Sonoma County’s go-to for getting out on the Petaluma River with kayaks\, paddle boards\, water bikes\, guided experiences\, and more. We know how to get you into the community.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/river-run-cold-plunge-with-sauna-4/
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma\, 50 Water Street\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Recreation
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:GoLocal Cooperative
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T130000
DTSTAMP:20251213T200330Z
CREATED:20251213T200258Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251213T200330Z
UID:55886-1780826400-1780837200@golocal.coop
SUMMARY:Boating at the Barn on the Petaluma River
DESCRIPTION:Explore the Petaluma River by boat through Friends’ FREE Boating at the Barn program. Use our fleet of kayaks\, canoes and stand-up-paddleboards to have your own River adventure and see the Petaluma River as you never have before. \nWe have life jackets from toddlers to adults\, and want to help you and your family experience the Petaluma River for yourself. This is an all-volunteer run program and we are always looking for new people to join our team on Sundays. Use the link below to sign up for an upcoming Sunday. \nHours: Sundays\, 10am – 1pm \nLocation: David Yearsley River Heritage Center (red barn)\, Steamer Landing Park\, 6 Copeland Street \nFREE \nDonations Welcome! Volunteers Needed!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/boating-at-the-barn-on-the-petaluma-river/
LOCATION:David Yearsley River Heritage Center\, 6 Copeland St.\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Recreation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Boating-at-the-barn-friends-petaluma-s-7mBe89.jpg
END:VEVENT
